[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3 uid="uid://dmazabblast2026"]

; Mazab's bomb blast -- the AoE that erupts when a landed LobProjectile's dwell timer ends.
; Instanced INSIDE the explosion Strike (scripts/combat/lob_projectile.gd::_explode), which
; owns the hitbox + self-frees; this scene is the look only. Set as Mazab's
; `lob_explosion_effect` in configs/level_config.gd. Steel-blue to match the thrown rock:
; a fast radial shard burst + a low ground dust puff, both one-shot so they fire once.

